abases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Bioprocess Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material balances"},{"text":"Energy balances"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Heat transfer"},{"text":"Mass transfer"},{"text":"Reaction engineering"},{"text":"Process engineering"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These engineering fundamentals distinguish a bioprocess engineer from a purely biological scientist."},{"type":"h","text":"Biochemical Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enzyme kinetics"},{"text":"Microbial growth"},{"text":"Cell growth kinetics"},{"text":"Substrate utilization"},{"text":"Product formation"},{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Oxygen transfer"},{"text":"Mixing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand relationships such as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Substrate","Microbial / Cell Growth","Metabolism","Product Formation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Microbial & Cell Culture Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand different production systems:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bacterial cultures"},{"text":"Yeast"},{"text":"Mammalian cells"},{"text":"Insect cells"},{"text":"Plant-based systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The specific organism or cell line depends on the product being manufactured."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Upstream Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Upstream processing focuses on generating and growing the biological production system before harvesting."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media preparation"},{"text":"Cell banking concepts"},{"text":"Inoculum development"},{"text":"Seed train"},{"text":"Cell culture"},{"text":"Fermentation"},{"text":"Bioreactor operation"},{"text":"Process parameters"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important parameters include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"pH"},{"text":"Dissolved oxygen"},{"text":"Agitation"},{"text":"Pressure"},{"text":"Nutrient concentrat